# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
**/node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
**/coverage/

# next.js (apps/web)
**/.next/
**/out/

# production
**/build/

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (keep *.example)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# .NET local secrets (do not commit)
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json

# .NET (apps/api)
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# Flutter (apps/mobile)
**/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
